{"channelId":"UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","row":["Bendy Bodies",11400,"Being “double-jointed” isn’t harmless!\n\nWelcome! I’m Dr. Linda Bluestein, an EDS patient & physician specializing in Ehlers-Danlos Syndromes & related disorders. I founded Hypermobility MD & Bendy Bodies to challenge outdated narratives & give people real answers, not dismissal.\n\nConnective tissue disorders often mean chronic pain, repeated injuries, fatigue, autonomic symptoms, & bodies that don’t behave the way medicine expects them to. This channel exists to make sense of that complexity.\n\nEach week, I share myth-busters, expert interviews, & practical strategies for managing pain, joint instability, fatigue, POTS, MCAS, & more. These conversations bridge science & lived experience—& remind us that being hard to diagnose is not the same as being difficult.\n\nSubscribe & turn on notifications so you don’t miss anything.\n\nInstagram: @hypermobilitymd\n\nDisclaimer: Content is educational & not a substitute for personalized medical advice. Always consult your own healthcare professional.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:28.654Z","channelId":"UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ff16e59b3d5c3f5d91d3222054e736de23b5f7682295adfcb272e0bd0607d34e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e3e819e4cd9033fffd85ed174cdaf026270ee1b9ac9b93096283b62ae05dd38c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:28.654Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":11400,"raw":"11.4K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjVCqYzQS0KRDknR0y5_sRA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20